# Defect-focused checks for the render, graphics, profiling, and asset layers.
# Run via scripts/run_render_tidy.sh, which needs a built compile database.
#
# Disabled checks and why:
#   bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters  fires on nearly every geometry and
#       Vulkan signature; the parameters are distinct concepts with the same
#       primitive type, which no rename fixes.
#   bugprone-narrowing-conversions        the engine is deliberately float for
#       transforms and 32-bit for GPU-facing indices; this fires on the
#       conversions that design implies.
#   performance-enum-size                 enum widths here are chosen, not
#       incidental. GPU-facing, cooked, and wire-facing enums carry the size
#       their format specifies, and shrinking one to fit its current value set
#       would change a layout the other side depends on.
#
# Comments cannot live inside the Checks block below: it is a YAML folded
# scalar, so a '#' there becomes part of the check string rather than a comment.
Checks: >
  bugprone-*,
  performance-*,
  -bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters,
  -bugprone-narrowing-conversions,
  -performance-enum-size
WarningsAsErrors: ''
HeaderFilterRegex: 'engine/(src|include)/(assets|render|graphics|profiling)/'
FormatStyle: none
